---
description: Flutter package public-API import boundaries
globs: flutter_app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

A package may only import another package's public API.

Allowed:
package_name.dart

Not allowed:
package_name/src/...

Never bypass package public APIs by importing another package's internal
implementation.

flutter_app/tool/verify_architecture.dart enforces package boundaries.

Run the architecture verification tool when relevant rather than assuming
compliance.
